OL,3,A'When England changed forever': Bayeux
OL,4,ATapestry and its most famous scene wow
OL,5,ALondon viewers
OL,6,
OL,7,FWant the best viewing experience? Get
OL,8,Fup close and keep an eye on the birds.
OL,9,FHere's everything else you need to know
OL,11,FFifty-eight scenes, 737 animals, 620
OL,12,Fmen, six women, and five (or maybe six)
OL,13,Fhuman penises - the Bayeux Tapestry in
OL,14,Fnumbers
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
