OL,3,APilot warned Amazon cargo plane going
OL,4,Atoo fast before deadly crash, data
OL,5,Ashows
OL,6,
OL,7,FA pilot onboard an Amazon cargo plane
OL,8,Fthat crashed in Miami, Florida, on
OL,9,FSunday noted it was going too fast
OL,10,Fbefore it overshot a runway, crashed
OL,11,Finto other vehicles and burst into
OL,12,Fflames, new flight data shows.
OL,14,FThe investigation update from the US
OL,15,FNational Transportation Safety Board
OL,16,F(NTSB) said one pilot warned the other
OL,17,Fin the cockpit multiple times about
OL,18,F"the aircraft's excessive speed" but
OL,19,Fnoted "there was but not a consistent
OL,20,Fverbal response", even as an altitude
OL,21,Falarm sounded.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
