OL,3,ATrump says every adult American will
OL,4,Aget $5,000 if Republicans win midterms
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump says he would
OL,7,Foffer every adult American a $5,000
OL,8,F(#3,700) payout if Republicans win both
OL,9,Fchambers of Congress in November's
OL,10,Fmidterm elections ` a plan that would
OL,11,Fcost more than a trillion dollars.
OL,13,FThe offer was made in a speech at the
OL,14,Fparty's first-ever convention in the
OL,15,Fmiddle of a US presidential term.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
