OL,3,AIsrael's Netanyahu to sue newspaper
OL,4,Aover claim UAE warned him of 7 October
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsrael's Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,8,FNetanyahu has told lawyers to begin
OL,9,Fdefamation proceedings against an
OL,10,FIsraeli newspaper over reports that the
OL,11,Fleader of the United Arab Emirates
OL,12,Fwarned him that Hamas was planning an
OL,13,Foperation just days before the 7
OL,14,FOctober 2023 attacks.
OL,16,FAccording to book extracts published by
OL,17,FHaaretz, UAE President Sheikh Mohammed
OL,18,Fbin Zayed Al Nahyan had a phone call
OL,19,Fwith Netanyahu that September.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
