OL,3,AIsrael's Netanyahu to sue newspaper
OL,4,Aover claim UAE warned him of 7 October
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe report said Netanyahu was warned
OL,8,Fthat the then-Hamas chief in Gaza,
OL,9,FYahya Sinwar, was planning a major
OL,10,Foperation.
OL,12,FNetanyahu's office said "no warning was
OL,13,Fgiven to the prime minister from the
OL,14,FUnited Arab Emirates before 7 October",
OL,15,Fcalling the report part of a "sinister
OL,16,Fplot".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
